    "amir's baby sister cried every time he practiced trumpet. he tried playing in the yard, but the neighbors leaned out of windows. he tried the bathroom, where the echo was wonderful but the space was not. in the end, the closet full of winter coats muffled the sound, and everyone was happy": "/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/amir-s-baby-sister-cried-every-time-he-practiced-trumpet-he-tried-playing--9e2a84174e.mp3",
